<title>USA: HMN Financial Inc Q4 net falls, shr rises.</title>
<headline>HMN Financial Inc Q4 net falls, shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING VALLEY, Minn 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.31		    $0.30</p>
<p> Net		 1,229		    1,437</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.96		    $1.09</p>
<p> Net		 4,274		    5,620</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 results include effects of a one-time $2.35 million assessment to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Share price rose because of the company's stock buyback program.</p>
<p>Net interest income was $3.94 million for Q4 1996, up from $3.88 million in 1995 Q4</p>
